{'symbol': 'WMB', 'date': '2022-08-08 07:00:00', 'title': 'WILLIAMS ENTERS AGREEMENT WITH PENNENERGY RESOURCES TO MARKET AND DELIVER CERTIFIED, LOW EMISSIONS NEXT GEN GAS', 'text': 'TULSA, OKLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WILLIAMS (NYSE: WMB) AND PENNENERGY RESOURCES, LLC, AN ENCAP INVESTMENTS PORTFOLIO COMPANY IN THE APPALACHIAN BASIN, ANNOUNCED TODAY THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO SUPPORT THE MARKETING AND DELIVERY OF CERTIFIED, LOW EMISSIONS NEXT GEN NATURAL GAS. THE AGREEMENT INCLUDES AN INDEPENDENT, THIRD-PARTY CERTIFICATION PROCESS THAT VERIFIES BEST PRACTICES ARE BEING FOLLOWED TO MINIMIZE EMISSIONS AND PRODUCE NATURAL GAS IN THE MOST ENVIRONMENTALLY RESPONSIBLE MANN'}